[View: WorkItemDetail]
route: /:workspaceSlug/browse/:workItem
memory:
  - Title is a bare <textarea>; edits autosave (no Save button)
  - Two .tiptap.ProseMirror editors exist - first is the description, second is the comment composer
  - State/priority/assignee are unlabeled buttons in the right rail showing the CURRENT value as text (e.g. "In Progress"); clicking opens a dropdown

